From: Alastair D'Silva <alastair@d-silva.org>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 19:02:20 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 56/56] sunxi: common: Import Allwinner platform updates from Armbian 7.2 series

Import platform updates from the Armbian 7.2 sunxi series and configure
direct non-secure MMIO for A733 under TF-A.

